{"name": "Northgale", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Northgale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master flight</strong> with your wind-possessed kite. <strong>Restore </strong>its <strong>power </strong>and <strong>return</strong> the <strong>Northwind</strong> to its mountain <strong>throne</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gif of the player looking out over the mystical land\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"518\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"920\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/c5181b3dc5c1330c400bc8b3969c7ca9.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master the wind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield the shattered god of the Northwind. What starts as a simple glide will evolve into <strong>mastery over the skies</strong>. Discover <strong>new abilities</strong> to overcome obstacles and conquer previously unreachable locations. Explore the secrets of an <strong>interconnected world</strong> designed for replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gif demonstrating the freedom of flight in Northgale\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"920\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/f598c4b38f53f7bb62ccacd2398e08eb.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your own protagonist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour the landscape for hidden dyes and patterns. Tailor your protagonist\u2019s look to reflect your journey through majestic fjords and misty forests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gif showcasing the character customization\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.poster.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"920\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.webm?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/33f83a5bd2aab7c361c362a17875bf81.mp4?t=1782497380\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is your puzzle. <strong>Solve wind-based challenges</strong> and navigate treacherous terrain. Use your kite to <strong>manipulate ancient mechanisms</strong>, open gates, and clear the path forward without ever drawing a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Scenery looking out over a forest enviroment\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/51fd2941ffaf3eb15a3073b4f59e49fa.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Northwind\u2019s uncontrolled powers have thrown the land into chaos. <strong>Solve puzzles &amp; overcome challenges </strong>to return these powers to the source and aid those you meet along the way. Gather resources on your journey to <strong>restore your ruined home</strong>, visually transforming a broken sanctuary into a thriving haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Screenshot of homestead building before the storm\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/b646d30d5c42d62643775ed2e1956a29.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore the north wind's might</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world steeped in <strong>Norwegian folklore</strong>. From lush valleys to frozen peaks, discover a land thrown into chaos. <strong>You carry no weapons, so you must outmaneuver the danger. Dodge hazards, master your flight, and turn the environment against the corruption to reclaim the land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Image of a misty pine forest.\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras_big/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/extras/a4c54d9e15aedb33d3db6269a6b40d66.avif?t=1782497380\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Skies:</strong> Physics-based kite flying that evolves as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration Adventure:</strong> A cozy exploration with a wholesome narrative to help those in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Norwegian Folklore:</strong> Creatures and narrative deeply rooted in folklore stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore Your Home:</strong> Gather resources and rebuild your now ruined home. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize:</strong> Find hidden dyes and patterns to customize your appearance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Harness the spirit of the Northern Wind in this cozy, physics-based exploration adventure. Soar through a hand-painted Nordic landscape with your kite, rescue hidden gnomes, and unlock new flight abilities to restore your ruined homestead. A peaceful journey inspired by Scandinavian folklore.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056820/370051d5ad7f551e514cca3f34f38d9d6f1fbad1/header.jpg?t=1782497380", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Female Protagonist", "Exploration", "Story Rich", "Cozy", "Atmospheric", "Relaxing"], "developers": "Myte Interactive", "publishers": "Myte Interactive", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4056820", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "26 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Icy840ogTkQ", "first_seen": 1782424800.0, "review_rank": 379}